{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7qalx7","slideIndex":0,"text":"Source review: carelink-handoff/backend/app/services/llm_extractor.py sends document image bytes and OCR text to Gemini. No identifier redaction is apparent in this extraction function. Extraction includes administrative facts and verbatim documented diagnoses/symptoms/medications, with no clinical inference, diagnosis, risk scoring, treatment advice or numeric clinical measurement extraction. carelink-handoff/backend/app/routers/records.py persists unverified/conflict drafts before review. Human confirmation before finalization is the safety boundary; never auto-saves would misstate draft persistence. carelink-handoff/backend/rag_pipeline.py sets retrieval confidence to zero and routes configured detected danger signs to the doctor. Retrieval similarity is not a clinical accuracy or risk probability. No claim of perfect danger-sign detection, a fixed 20% doctor review rate, no cloud transmission or verified provider no-training terms is made. Voice remains in progress per supplied sprint status. Consent and privacy requirements are design commitments; full implementation and provider-policy compliance were not audited."}